{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25795","headline":"宿扬州 · 李绅","name":"宿扬州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江横渡阔烟波晚，潮过金陵落叶秋。\n嘹唳塞鸿经楚泽，浅深红树见扬州。\n夜桥灯火连星汉，水郭帆樯近斗牛。\n今日市朝风俗变，不须开口问迷楼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李绅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25795.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25795","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}